{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0969",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“可这到底是怎么回事呀……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But what on earth is going on here...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "幸好我们从后边追了过来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Good thing we came after you from behind,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你可真造孽，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "you have really done something terrible,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这周围呐，连狗也不靠近哇……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "around here, even dogs will not come near...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "可危险呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is terribly dangerous...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "搞不清有多少人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No one knows how many people",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "糊里糊涂就这么一去不复返喽……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "have wandered off in confusion and never come back...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "正好是山背面，成了旋风口哇……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is right on the far side of the hill, where the whirlwinds pass through...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "冬天刮风下雪……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In winter the wind blows and the snow falls...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "而且，还刮沙子呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and on top of that, the sand blows too...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "在那之上，又堆积了一层雪，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then another layer of snow piles up over it,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "这样大约一百年，像薄薄的煎饼似的层层堆叠起来……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and after about a hundred years of that, the layers stack up like thin pancakes...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "这还是听以前的联合组织长家里，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is what I heard from the family of the former head of the cooperative,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "那个去镇上学校的二小子说的呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "from their second son who went to school in town...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "可真带劲儿……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is really something...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00969",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "往底下挖下去，弄不好还能挖出些个值钱东西来呢……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you dig down underneath, you might even turn up something valuable...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
